      "updated": 1775227776433,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "* Controle\nPlanning\n- planCreate, planGenerate, planList, planGet, planUpdateStep, planNextAction, planExecuteNext, planReconcile\nJobs\n- listJobs, getJob, getJobLog\n\n* Execucao\nShell\n- execCommand, processCommand\nMemory\n- memorySearch, memoryGet, memoryWrite\nWorkspace\n- workspaceSearch, workspaceRead\nWeb/Research\n- webSearch, webFetch, webResearch\nBrowser\n- browserCommand, browserRuntimeTelemetry\n\n* Especificas\nImage\n- imageGenerate\nVideo (jobs)\n- startTranscode, startConvertHls, startCaptureStream, startProbeMedia, startPlayVlc\nVideo (inspeção)\n- videoHlsInspect, videoProbe\n\nModo chat-only: desabilita execução, video, browser, images e planning.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "* Controle\nPlanning\n- planCreate, planGenerate, planList, planGet, planUpdateStep, planNextAction, planExecuteNext, planReconcile\nJobs\n- listJobs, getJob, getJobLog\n\n* Execucao\nShell\n- execCommand, processCommand\nMemory\n- memorySearch, memoryGet, memoryWrite\nWorkspace\n- workspaceSearch, workspaceRead\nWeb/Research\n- webSearch, webFetch, webResearch\nBrowser\n- browserCommand, browserRuntimeTelemetry\n\n* Especificas\nImage\n- imageGenerate\nVideo (jobs)\n- startTranscode, startConvertHls, startCaptureStream, startProbeMedia, startPlayVlc\nVideo (inspeção)\n- videoHlsInspect, videoProbe\n\nModo chat-only: desabilita execução, video, browser, images e planning.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
